SUMMARY:20's & 30's Interchapter Fall Fest: Wells State Park
LOCATION:Wells State Park\, 159 Walker Pond R\nSturbridge\, MA 01566
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, October 17\, 2026 | 11:45 AM\nhttps://activities.ou
 tdoors.org/s/oc-activity/a5UVX000001K5m92AC/\nCelebrate fall and join us f
 or a 6 mile hike through the scenic forests of Wells State Park. The trail
 s will offer easy to moderate terrain with a total elevation gain of 500-f
 t and we plan to move at a moderate pace between 1.5 and 2 mph.Proper equi
 pment will be required for this hike\, including: hiking and weather appro
 priate clothing\, water\, a day pack\, trail snacks\, and raingear. No dog
 s please. As hunting season has begun\, it is advisable to wear blaze ora
 nge (vest or hat) while hiking.After the hike\, you are invited to join us
  at a nearby (15 minutes away) social with other 20's and 30's from the Na
 rragansett\, Worcester\, Western MA\, Connecticut\, and Southeast Massachu
 setts AMC chapters.If you are interested\, please register for the Tree Ho
 use Social at this link: https://activities.outdoors.org/s/oc-activity/a5U
 VX000001Id8o/act00023773.
END:VEVENT
