SUMMARY:20s & 30s Full Moon Haunted Hike
LOCATION:41 Mile Hill R\nWestminster\, MA 01473
DESCRIPTION:Monday\, October 26\, 2026 | 6:30 PM\nhttps://activities.outdo
 ors.org/s/oc-activity/a5UVX000001JL6b2AG/\nTRAIL CULT PRESENTS...FULL MOON
  HIKE SERIES -- OCTOBER--CONFIDENTIAL--CLEARANCE: 20s & 30s\, ████
 ███\, CultistsSUMMARYThe Moon. It's always there. Watching us. Who k
 nows what it wants? ████ ███ knows. That's who. Also aliens.
  Aliens know. But do we know about aliens?Some would have you believe █
 █████████ that there are mysterious ████ cabals 
 within world governments\, █████\, cults (that are less cool tha
 n TRAIL CULT\, obviously)\, classified █████ programs\, and more
  that hold the secrets ██████ to the universe and our neighbor
 s within it.The airwaves and █████ internets are flooded with so
 -called "reveals" of ███████ classified documents\, whistle 
 blowers emerging from ████ the shadows\, and even the occasional 
 ███████ extraterrestrial corpse popping up on TMZ. If these 
 ███████\, █████\, ███\, and wackadoos are to
  be believed\, the aliens have been █████ here for much longer t
 han we thought. Such bastions of ████ science and knowledge as the
  History Channel and National Enquirer ███ regularly showcase "theor
 ies" on these supposed ███████ ancient aliens.But what's rea
 lly going on there? Like █████ rrreeeaaalllllyyyy? Hm? HMM!?!? 
 ███████████ We'll tell you. Yes. Us. We. The ██
 ████ and the ██████ sponsored by ██████\, 
 a subsidiary of ███████. That's who.October 26\, under the r
 evealing light of the █████ full moon\, we shall evade prying ey
 es and ██████ traverse into the wilderness to de-classify secr
 ets\, ████\, myths\, urban legends\, and ██████.Using 
 Wachusett Mountain as a ██████ base of operations\, we'll patr
 ol the woods and divulge an extraterrestrial history lesson on ███
 ████ the movers and shakers who have kept the ancient aliens debat
 e alive. And why they are wrong. Oh so wrong. Like not even funny how wron
 g they are. Like it's ██████████ how wrong they are.Th
 is is the Full Moon Hike they don't want you to know about.Things to be aw
 are of:There is █████████ ███ ██████Th
 is is an accessible hike. We will hike as a group and take rests as needed
 .Appropriate gear is required (boots/hiking shoes\, █████\, wate
 r\, backpack)This hike will be at night. A flashlight is required.Costumes
  are welcome in order to shroud yourself in anonymity. █████ are
  always watching after all.TRAIL CULT hikes are one part hike\, one part h
 istory lesson\, 30% occult trappings\, and a dash of ██████. P
 ast hikes have included the history of parapsychology and ESP\, tarot\, th
 e Salem Witch Trials\, Mothman\, and more. For other subjects\, please ref
 er to file number ███████ for full report. Believers and non
 -believers are welcome. ██████ are not.This hike is a 20s & 30
 s affinity trip. If you are not a part of this group\, please consider a d
 ifferent activity to sign up for.
