SUMMARY:20s & 30s October Social at Seven Saws Brewing Company
LOCATION:112 Industrial D\nHolden\, MA
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday\, October 28\, 2026 | 6:00 PM\nhttps://activities.ou
 tdoors.org/s/oc-activity/a5UVX000001KmBB2A0/\nJoin the Worcester 20s & 30s
  for our October social! We'll be at Seven Saws Brewing Company in Holden\
 , MA on Wednesday\, October 28th starting at 6pm. Socialize with other you
 ng members and leaders from the Worcester Chapter and learn about fun upco
 ming trips and activities this fall. Seven Saws offers a rotating selectio
 n of craft beers\, wine\, hard cider\, hard seltzer and non-alcoholic beve
 rages. Monti Farms food truck will be there from 5-9pm. Feel free to join
  when you can. Looking forward to seeing you there!20s & 30s is a group wi
 thin AMC that is dedicated to encouraging people in their 20s and 30s to e
 njoy the outdoors. Registration is required so the leader can be in touch 
 in case of a change of venue.
